<title>USA: CN Biosciences IPO due this week.</title>
<headline>CN Biosciences IPO due this week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>CN Biosciences Inc's initial public offering has been rescheduled for this week, according to lead underwriter UBS Securities.</p>
<p>The deal, originally filed with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission in July, had been taken off the calendar for some time due to market conditions.</p>
<p>CN's proposed IPO terms of 1.6 million shares to price in an estimated range of $12.50 to $13.50 remains the same.</p>
</text>
